{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 582392, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 116352, "uid": 63428, "type": 4, "title": "2.2 水Raid攻略", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1675330072, "updated_at": 1675347991, "updated_uid": 63428, "comment_at": 1676109022, "last_at": 1676109022, "comment_count": 132, "status": 1, "summary": "本期Boss难点其实不多，主要在于：1.超高的DoT伤害，对玩家们的装备有比较高的要求。2.增益吸收让你的Buff掉光所以本期我建议所有辅助都穿上减益回避率魂卡，装备要穿好，否则真的会暴毙！并且辅助的", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_697/h_1069/202/63428/2023/1/2/763190.jfif,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1544/h_9765/202/63428/2023/1/2/482120.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1334/h_5001/202/63428/2023/1/2/221723.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 21, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 44866, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "江西省", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 8, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 582392, "content": "<div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"Boss信息分析\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"697\" data-height=\"1069\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_697/h_1069/202/63428/2023/1/2/763190.jfif\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_697/h_1069/202/63428/2023/1/2/763190.jfif\"></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\">本期Boss难点其实不多，主要在于：</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">1.超高的DoT伤害，对玩家们的装备有比较高的要求。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">2.增益吸收让你的Buff掉光</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\"><div class=\"div-img\">所以本期我建议所有辅助都穿上减益回避率魂卡，装备要穿好，否则真的会暴毙！</div><div class=\"div-img\">并且辅助的T不能打得太多，防止被解Buff来不及补</div><div class=\"div-img\">尤娜是本期的究极对策，有尤娜的话生存能力会大幅度提高。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"Raid对策分析\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container active-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">详细评价</span></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1544\" data-height=\"9765\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1544/h_9765/202/63428/2023/1/2/482120.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1544/h_9765/202/63428/2023/1/2/482120.png\"></div></div>\n                               </div><br><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">萨拉苏是安妮专用辅助，和珀皮塔队伍没有任何关系。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">但是即使你用的是珀皮塔，我依然建议你把萨拉苏点火，因为珀皮塔不可能让你在Raid用一辈子的，以国际服策划一直以来的尿性来说。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">下期水Raid必然是新的TS百分比刀，也就是说萨拉苏下期必然成为最佳阵容中的一员，如果你这次不点火，那下次就比较麻烦了，亏了点火返利。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">所以我建议：</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(200, 3, 3);\">有资源的尽量点火，不需要抽高+</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">如果实在没资源，其实也没事，你可以放弃萨拉苏，不会有特别大的影响，就是小亏一点点火返利而已。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"Buff表\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1334\" data-height=\"5001\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1334/h_5001/202/63428/2023/1/2/221723.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1334/h_5001/202/63428/2023/1/2/221723.png\"></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"附魔＆魂卡\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1331\" data-height=\"2630\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1331/h_2630/202/63428/2023/1/2/457303.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1331/h_2630/202/63428/2023/1/2/457303.p